Global correctness: open-gain (run 1).
An open holding with market value above its remaining basis produces a
positive unrealized gain.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight unrealized-gains --to 2024-03-31 --format json <<'LEDGER'
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.000 FUND
account Assets:Bank
account Assets:Broker

P 2024-03-01 FUND 120 USD

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  10 FUND {100 USD}
  Assets:Bank  -1000 USD
LEDGER

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Broker",
    "quantity": "200",
    "commodity": "USD"
  }
]
